    "title": "Qatari LNG tanker awaits salvage off Oman after projectile strike",
    "description": "LONDON/DOHA: A Qatari LNG tanker remained stranded off Oman on Wednesday after ​a projectile strike sparked a fire in its engine room, though industry sources said the vessel’s cargo appeared secure and the risk of an explosion was low for now. The attacks on the tankers prompted Washington to revoke a license allowing Iran to sell oil and US forces to strike Iranian targets",
